Third-party data bundled with JobBuddy

Danish postal codes and their coordinates
  File:    backend/src/main/resources/geo/dk-postal-places.tsv
  Source:  GeoNames postal code dump, https://download.geonames.org/export/zip/DK.zip
  Credit:  GeoNames, https://www.geonames.org/
  Licence: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
  Changes: postcodes below 1000 (PO boxes, abroad) removed; columns reduced to postcode,
           place, municipality, latitude and longitude.

Fonts for the document renderer
  Files:   backend/src/main/resources/typst/fonts/
  Source:  Google Fonts, https://github.com/google/fonts; Inter 4.1, https://github.com/rsms/inter;
           Liberation 2.1.5, https://github.com/liberationfonts/liberation-fonts; Merriweather,
           https://github.com/SorkinType/Merriweather
  Licence: SIL Open Font License 1.1; each family's licence file sits beside its fonts.
  Changes: Noto Sans (notosans/) subset to Latin, Greek and Cyrillic; variable font files
           renamed without their axis tags.

Icons in the CV layouts
  File:    backend/src/main/resources/typst/resume.typ (the line-icons table)
  Source:  Lucide 1.51.0, https://github.com/lucide-icons/lucide; brand marks from Lucide 0.400.0
  Licence: ISC, with the Feather-derived icons under MIT; full text in
           backend/src/main/resources/typst/LICENSE-lucide.txt
  Changes: SVG path data copied into a Typst dictionary; no shapes altered.
